### Health Check API
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Get Enterprise Features
GET http://localhost:3000/api/features

### Get All Enterprise Programs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/programs

### Filter Programs by Category (Data & AI)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/programs?category=data-ai

### Get Testimonials
GET http://localhost:3000/api/testimonials

### Get All FAQs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/faqs

### Search FAQs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/faqs?q=pricing

### Get Statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/statistics

### Submit Contact Form
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sarah Jenkins",
  "workEmail": "sarah.j@acmetech.com",
  "companyName": "Acme Enterprise",
  "phone": "+1 (555) 019-2834",
  "teamSize": "50-200",
  "interestedProgram": "Enterprise Executive AI Transformation",
  "message": "We would like to train 100 senior software leads in agentic AI."
}

